commits.map

Made by git filter-repo (its filter-repo/commit-map) on 2026-11-03, when the owner's private material was taken out of every commit (delta-version issue 063). One line per rewritten commit: the old full id, then the new one; a new id of forty zeros means the commit held nothing but removed files and was dropped. Old ids quoted anywhere (transcripts, issues, the first graft's map) translate through this file.
